{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I don’t want my old life back. I want this version of it. My people, my health, my body, my business, where I live and everything I have built.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"}], "text": "The author reflects on not wanting their old life back, but instead cherishes the current version of it with their people, health, body, business, and achievements."}, "title": "Life Reflection", "topic": "gratitude and reflection"}, "content_hash": "95e778a44db593c57ff1a553ce7410d848e0519176d1c3ead9a6cd65409596a4", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:knowledge:2a59321aee67df4a", "metadata_hash": "14739b1020d476369c422bfb04848b60ae399cdb488d455dfa2c0d4c48649f2d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-11T16:08:20Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d75913a7f1659cacc2049573086d40b7457e1757c05e8a9135418878d025bbe0", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaqJf1hiPjA/", "title": "Life Reflection", "topic": "gratitude and reflection", "topic_slug": "gratitude-and-reflection"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "How much would I pay to go back to being 26? Or even 36? Honestly? Nothing.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"}], "text": "Reflect on how much one would pay to go back to a younger age and consider gratitude for the present life."}, "title": "Gratitude Exercise", "topic": "gratitude and reflection"}, "content_hash": "95e778a44db593c57ff1a553ce7410d848e0519176d1c3ead9a6cd65409596a4", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:knowledge:eb2cbe4c86263b29", "metadata_hash": "14739b1020d476369c422bfb04848b60ae399cdb488d455dfa2c0d4c48649f2d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-11T16:08:20Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d75913a7f1659cacc2049573086d40b7457e1757c05e8a9135418878d025bbe0", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaqJf1hiPjA/", "title": "Gratitude Exercise", "topic": "gratitude and reflection", "topic_slug": "gratitude-and-reflection"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I want to build every day … to arrive there feeling that’s it’s the best time… not regretting my 40s.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"}], "text": "The author wants to build every day to feel that reaching an older age will be the best time without regretting their 40s."}, "title": "Future Aspirations", "topic": "aspirations and goals"}, "content_hash": "95e778a44db593c57ff1a553ce7410d848e0519176d1c3ead9a6cd65409596a4", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:knowledge:54e22e88d2a7a003", "metadata_hash": "14739b1020d476369c422bfb04848b60ae399cdb488d455dfa2c0d4c48649f2d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-07-11T16:08:20Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d75913a7f1659cacc2049573086d40b7457e1757c05e8a9135418878d025bbe0", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaqJf1hiPjA/", "title": "Future Aspirations", "topic": "aspirations and goals", "topic_slug": "aspirations-and-goals"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001", "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000002"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "How much would I pay to go back to being 26? Or even 36? Honestly? Nothing.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"}], "text": "The author would pay nothing to return to their younger self, preferring their current life."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "In 20 years, you would give everything to be where you are right now. At this age, in this body, living this exact life.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:u000001"}], "text": "The author discusses how they would value their current life over going back to a younger age."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Reflection on Aging", "topic": "gratitude and reflection"}, "content_hash": "95e778a44db593c57ff1a553ce7410d848e0519176d1c3ead9a6cd65409596a4", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136:cases:8ff136a462877e5a", "metadata_hash": "14739b1020d476369c422bfb04848b60ae399cdb488d455dfa2c0d4c48649f2d", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-07-11T16:08:20Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d75913a7f1659cacc2049573086d40b7457e1757c05e8a9135418878d025bbe0", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-07-11-in-20-years-you-would-md-cd9d349136", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaqJf1hiPjA/", "title": "Reflection on Aging", "topic": "gratitude and reflection", "topic_slug": "gratitude-and-reflection"}
